{
    "title": "Spreaker Podcasts",
    "description": "Enjoy your favorite shows and discover thousands more!\r\nPlus, Spreaker Podcasts offers a unique experience to listen to what you like, comment on your favorite episodes, and share your love of podcasts with friends and followers.\r\n\r\nWhat we love about Spreaker:\r\n\r\n- <b>Curated lists</b>: discover the best podcasts for each topic and categories like True Crime, Technology, or News.\r\n- <b>Discussions</b>: comment on the episode with the community, chat with podcast hosts, and share your favorite podcasts with the world.\r\n- <b>All your favorites</b>: keep all your preferred podcasts in the Following Section, and download episodes to access them at any time offline.\r\n- <b>Powerful playback</b>: rewind and fast-forward through podcast episodes, use the slider to get to the exact minute mark, change the play speed of your choice, and no more wasted episodes with the sleep timer.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n- Powerful Curated lists let you discover a whole new world of content\r\n- Like, and commenting options to interact with your favorite content\r\n- Share the episodes on Instagram, Facebook, or WhatsApp\r\n- Automatically generated playlists like Downloads, Listen Later, Likes, and History\r\n- Android Auto and Google Cast integrations let you access the player anywhere\r\n- Easily Sign up via Google, email, Facebook or Twitter/X\r\n\r\n For further info, the team is always available at support@spreaker.com or join us at our Help Center at https://help.spreaker.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Enjoy your favorite shows and discover thousands more!<br>Plus, Spreaker Podcasts offers a unique experience to listen to what you like, comment on your favorite episodes, and share your love of podcasts with friends and followers.<br><br>What we love about Spreaker:<br><br>- <b>Curated lists</b>: discover the best podcasts for each topic and categories like True Crime, Technology, or News.<br>- <b>Discussions</b>: comment on the episode with the community, chat with podcast hosts, and share your favorite podcasts with the world.<br>- <b>All your favorites</b>: keep all your preferred podcasts in the Following Section, and download episodes to access them at any time offline.<br>- <b>Powerful playback</b>: rewind and fast-forward through podcast episodes, use the slider to get to the exact minute mark, change the play speed of your choice, and no more wasted episodes with the sleep timer.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>- Powerful Curated lists let you discover a whole new world of content<br>- Like, and commenting options to interact with your favorite content<br>- Share the episodes on Instagram, Facebook, or WhatsApp<br>- Automatically generated playlists like Downloads, Listen Later, Likes, and History<br>- Android Auto and Google Cast integrations let you access the player anywhere<br>- Easily Sign up via Google, email, Facebook or Twitter/X<br><br> For further info, the team is always available at support@spreaker.com or join us at our Help Center at https://help.spreaker.com",
